<view class="container"><view class="brand">{{name}}的请假申请</view><view class="card"><view class="label">请假类型</view><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="type">{{types[typeIndex]}}</picker><view class="label">请假开始日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="date">{{start}}</picker><view wx:if="{{typeIndex === 2}}"><view class="label">请假天数</view><input type="number" value="{{duration}}" bindinput="duration" bindblur="durationDone" placeholder="至少 3 天"/></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{typeIndex !== 3}}">请假范围：{{start}} 至 {{end}}。审批等级由服务端按日期跨度计算。</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{typeIndex === 2}}">请勾选最后一天需要请假的课次；前序日期的课程会一并提交。</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{typeIndex === 3}}">学期休学默认覆盖 120 天内的课程，必须上传材料图片。</view><checkbox-group wx:if="{{typeIndex !== 3}}" bindchange="select"><label class="row" wx:for="{{lessons}}" wx:key="id"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.selected}}" color="#7766ed"/><view class="grow">{{item.day}} 第 {{item.period}} 节<br/>{{item.name}}</view></label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{typeIndex !== 3 && !lessons.length}}" class="muted">范围内暂无课次</view><view class="label">请假原因</view><textarea value="{{reason}}" maxlength="2000" bindinput="reason" placeholder="填写原因"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="upload">{{attachment ? attachment.name : '上传 PNG / JPEG 凭证图片'}}</button><view class="muted">图片最大 5MB；学期休学必须提供材料。</view><button bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">提交申请</button></view><view class="label">我的申请</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{applications}}" wx:key="id"><view>#{{item.id}} · {{item.status}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.start_date}} 至 {{item.end_date}} · {{item.span_days}} 天</view><view>{{item.reason}}</view><view class="muted" wx:for="{{item.log}}" wx:for-item="log" wx:key="time">{{log.name}} · {{log.decision}} · {{log.opinion}}</view></view><view class="label">站内通知</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{notifications}}" wx:key="id">{{item.body}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="history">刷新记录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view>
